i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ux9zwqzjqDAQ7kNvwGr07oV&_nc_oc=Adq-0Wq6WpeExlRoTrtwaPSKtO5YqutBKlo59jyX1vA5TgEUemtA9nKF0WuWyr89ywY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRhGbjfBtew7AP16t-wAHToA9h1QudRd1zh5Q1Zap7bYQ&oe=6AF9E763"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YSseRdWYXxQQ7kNvwEzg94B&_nc_oc=Ado4PLe1j2bbTy2HW_nHXEfstYuHHrDvQomH6EZwEk9gyDI5UM_ipVyNGOI1z5rC5tk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTMPlSitjx7VLIVru_1Z2Tw8UaZD3GqzLjAsQ_7tzjUcQ&oe=6AF9D35D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IkTFEFTdgBYQ7kNvwEM0t0f&_nc_oc=Adq44eI7UmXPZ9G0ZVZKVtdJ0352xCztmH3-jXNGs_4MqiC4mKeNMMjcJSW1AJ3QDYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS0fqABUAMJzJ3b6EroXshw--oYLDYXaT2Sbx9doXBk_Q&oe=6AF9C1CA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im